cally once properly and  fully vaccinated  it is you know you are materially safer  but my message to everybody is look  let's try and  get out of where we are through the  successful use of vaccines  once can we just do it properly once  so please hold the line  just a little bit longer and we're only  talking a few more months  just hold the line because it will get  better  thanks very much dr ramsey yes i mean i  think it's  it's not just about yourself of course  with vaccination it's about protecting  others and of course  uh we want as high level of protection  as possible before we really want people  to start  behaving more as they as they used to so  i think our message is quite clear  um you know once you've had your vaccine  it'll take a while  please don't change your change your  behavior try and carry on  as much as you can keeping to the rules  keeping the distance  and avoiding unnecessary contact  thanks very much indeed yes  about the dates for unlocking the road  map are those dates set in stone  as the earliest possible dates yes  they're set out in the roadmap um  and the reason for those dates is to  give five weeks between steps so that we  can see the effect  of each step uh before making a decision  after four weeks with a week to go as to  whether we're able to take the next step  it's a it's a cautious but we hope  irreversible path and the effectiveness  of the vaccine that  dr ramsey set out today gives me  increased confidence  that we're going to be able to walk down  that road  as set out in the road map and um  we can see that the vaccines are making  people safe  and saving lives and we're on track on  the vaccine side  and we've seen the cases coming down  critically we're seeing the number of  hospitalizations  and deaths falling very sharply and that  is good news for us all  thanks very much indeed


